==English==
===Etymology===
From {{AGr.}} '''{{polytonic|[[πλουτοκρατία]]}}''' (ploutokratia) "rule of the wealthy" < '''{{polytonic|[[πλουτοκρατέω]]}}''' (ploutokrateō) "I rule through wealth" < '''{{polytonic|[[πλοῦτος]]}}''' (ploutos) "wealth" + '''{{polytonic|[[κρατέω]]}}''' (krateō) "I rule" < '''{{polytonic|[[κράτος]]}}''' (kratos) "power, might".

